+ natural_square (x y : ℕ) : 2*x*y ≤ x*x+y*y
  auto
+ natural_power (x y : ℕ) : 2*x*y ≤ x^2+y^2
  auto
+ renamed_bound (orchid maple : ℕ) : 2*orchid*maple ≤ orchid^2+maple^2
  auto
+ compound_product (a b c d : ℕ) : 2*(a*b)*(c*d) ≤ (a*b)*(a*b)+(c*d)*(c*d)
  auto
+ compound_power (a b c d : ℕ) : 2*(a*b)*(c*d) ≤ (a*b)^2+(c*d)^2
  auto
+ reversed_product (x y : ℕ) : y*x*2 ≤ x^2+y^2
  auto
+ reversed_sum (x y : ℕ) : 2*x*y ≤ y^2+x^2
  auto
+ shifted_inputs (x y : ℕ) : 2*(x+1)*(y+2) ≤ (x+1)^2+(y+2)^2
  auto
